# Software industry mapping for BKS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/bks/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_backend_service owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductBackendService .
legacy:product_backend_service_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productBackendServiceId .
legacy:implements_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:implementsProductEdition .
